## Absolute Constraints — NEVER violate these
1. NEVER modify any file in the PyKotor workspace
2. NEVER modify src/core/creature_appearance.py snap_head_onto_body (Bug B was misdiagnosed)
3. NEVER reintroduce centroid-magnitude heuristics for vertex space classification
4. NEVER treat skin node vertices as world-space — they are always NODE_LOCAL
5. Quaternion convention is XYZW (W-last) throughout — do not change this
6. All MDL loads MUST go through read_mdl_safe (src/core/mdl_reader_wrapper.py)
7. GhostRigger does NOT need its GUI running for MCP tools to work — they import Python modules directly

## Key Architecture Files (do not delete or rename)
- src/core/kotor_loader.py — MDL/MDX loader
- src/core/model_data.py — in-memory model graph
- src/core/vertex_space.py — VertexSpace enum (NODE_LOCAL, WORLD, AABB_WALK)
- src/core/render_constants.py — unified INNER_GEO_SUBSTRINGS, FACE_MESH_SUBSTRINGS
- src/core/pykotor_mdl_io_fix.py — K2 trimesh header monkey-patch
- src/core/mdl_reader_wrapper.py — safe MDL reader wrapper
- src/gui/gpu_renderer.py — GPU rendering pipeline
- src/gui/viewport.py — CPU PIL renderer
- src/gui/main_window.py — main application window
- tools/model_inspector.py — headless CLI inspector
